gehst</p><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0;font-size: 24px;line-height: 30px;color: #3061ac;display: block;padding: 0;font-family: Helvetica;font-style: normal;font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: left;\">Die Angebote vom Abend</h2><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;\">Beim Sail-Off haben wir zwei Kojen-Törns 2027 vorgestellt – und die gelten natürlich auch für dich. Du buchst eine einzelne Koje, Skipper Manuel ist an Bord, Segelkenntnisse brauchst du keine.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 10px 4px 10px;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><a href=\"https://www.yacht-urlaub.net/kabinen#dubrovnik\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img alt=\"Katamaran-Trampolin mit Blick auf die Altstadt von Dubrovnik\" src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/cefebb6fcf8136469892f293c/images/1b59ed51-367a-1f5a-b02e-f114804837d2.jpg\" width=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px;max-width: 100%;height: auto;border-radius: 6px;display: block;border: 0;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"></a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 10px 10px 6px 10px;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;font-size: 19px;font-weight: bold;color: #3061ac;padding: 0;font-family: Helvetica;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;\">📍 Dubrovnik – 7 Nächte zwischen Elaphiten, Korčula und Mljet</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 6px 0;\">📅 05.–12.06.2027 · ⛵ Katamaran Bali 4.1 · Skipper Manuel · ab ACI Marina Dubrovnik</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 6px 0;\"><span style=\"color:#999999; text-decoration:line-through\">€ 1.980,–</span> <strong style=\"color:#222222; font-size:18px\">€ 1.390,– pro Koje</strong> <span style=\"color:#666666\">(pro Person)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 8px 0;font-size: 14px;\">Altstadt vom Wasser aus, Austern in Ston, das mittelalterliche Korčula und die Salzseen von Mljet. Nur 6 Kojen, Abfahrt ab 5 Teilnehmern.</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.yacht-urlaub.net/kabinen#dubrovnik\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #3061ac;font-weight: bold;text-decoration: none;\">➜ Details &amp; Koje anfragen</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 20px 10px 4px 10px;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><a href=\"https://www.yacht-urlaub.net/kabinen#bvi\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img alt=\"Traumstrand auf den British Virgin Islands\" src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/cefebb6fcf8136469892f293c/images/ea7c6934-a909-633e-8313-91ccbd978089.jpg\" width=\"540\" style=\"width: 540px;max-width: 100%;height: auto;border-radius: 6px;display: block;border: 0;outline: none;text-decoration: none;-ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"></a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 10px 10px 6px 10px;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;font-size: 19px;font-weight: bold;color: #3061ac;padding: 0;font-family: Helvetica;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;\">📍 British Virgin Islands – 10 Nächte zwischen Tortola, Jost Van Dyke, Anegada und Virgin Gorda</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 6px 0;\">📅 27.02.–09.03.2027 · ⛵ Katamaran Bali 4.2 · Skipper Manuel · ab Tortola</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 6px 0;\"><span style=\"color:#999999; text-decoration:line-through\">€ 2.910,–</span> <strong style=\"color:#222222; font-size:18px\">€ 2.330,– pro Koje</strong> <span style=\"color:#666666\">(pro Person)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;margin: 0 0 8px 0;font-size: 14px;\">The Baths, Hummer auf Anegada und Painkiller an der White Bay – während bei uns noch Winter ist. 8 Kojen, Abfahrt ab 6 Teilnehmern.</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0;padding: 0;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;color: #757575;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.yacht-urlaub.net/kabinen#bvi\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #3061ac;font-weight: bold;text-decoration: none;\">➜ Details &amp; Koje anfragen</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 18px 10px 6px 10px;mso-line-height-rule: exactly;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td alig